# Databases the own-server helper (deploy-to-endpoint) manages on YOUR MySQL server.
# Format:  TYPE|NAME|TOKEN|PACKAGE
#   TYPE    = bootstrap (created directly) | product (deployed by SchemaQuench)
#   NAME    = database name (lowercase by convention; names are case-sensitive on Linux, lower_case_table_names=0). Rename
#             here to avoid colliding with a real database of the same name on your
#             server; the helper drops/creates this name.
#   TOKEN   = (product rows) the DB-name script token overridden into SchemaQuench.
#   PACKAGE = (product rows) the package folder under Demos/MySQL/.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
bootstrap|TestMain||
product|adventureworks|AdventureWorksDb|AdventureWorks
product|northwind|NorthwindDb|Northwind
product|sakila|SakilaDb|Sakila
product|chinook|ChinookDb|Chinook
